title: Act_III_Reunion
tags:
---
Heart: Mind! There you are!

Mind: You...Heart! I thought I lost you!

Heart: I thought I’d lost you too! I was so scared, so scared that you...

Mind: I know... But we’re together again, and that’s what matters.

Heart: Mind...what did you see down there?

Mind: 3 Mementos, each of them very vague. They were from...I can't remember. 

Heart: I saw them too! They're not from our past, Mind. They're from Madeline.

Heart: Her memories are lost...we need to get back to the Mind Palace immediately.

Heart: ...

Heart: ...Mind...I'm sorry I didn't listen to you. I shouldn't have been so reckless. If I didn't break that mementos...

Mind: Hush. We’re together again, and that’s what matters. 

Mind: We will find our way out. Let's go save Madeline's memories.

